WEBVTT

00:04:58.156 --> 00:05:00.236
Roofing materials matter, too.

00:05:00.436 --> 00:05:04.956
In India, modular roofing panels 
made from paper and waste wood

00:05:04.956 --> 00:05:07.676
can reduce the temperatures
by up to 10 degrees centigrade

00:05:07.676 --> 00:05:08.796
in the homes below.

00:05:09.516 --> 00:05:11.276
And we can change windows, too.

00:05:11.796 --> 00:05:13.876
In the European Union,

00:05:13.876 --> 00:05:19.356
solar control glass is available
that provides high daylight transmission,

00:05:19.356 --> 00:05:21.476
thermal insulation,

00:05:21.476 --> 00:05:22.476
transparency

00:05:22.476 --> 00:05:24.036
and low reflection.

00:05:25.396 --> 00:05:29.796
Second, we need to make 
cooling hyperefficient.